    Convert a two-dimensional dataset df0 to a dictionary according to orientation var0.
    Requires pandas >= 2.2.0 (2024+ release).

    Parameters
    - df0: any object convertible to a pandas.DataFrame (DataFrame, list of dicts, 2D list/array, dict of lists, etc.)
    - var0: orientation string, one of:
